Subject: [PATCH 195/230] feat(calendar): month-view date picker sheet for
 jumping to any match day
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The strip only reaches three weeks, so a user chasing a match further back
had no way to get there. A calendar button at the end of the strip now opens
a month picker that lands the feed on any date, in the sheet the rest of
the app already uses.

